@startuml hil-review-classes
set separator none
title K9-AIF 1.25.0 tool gate classes and the existing ABBs they use

package "New in 1.25.0 (k9_core/tools)" {
  class BaseToolDispatcher {
    +propose(call, connector, session)
    +resume(reply)
    +expire_stale()
  }
  class ToolRegistry {
    +lookup(tool_name): ToolSpec
  }
  class ToolSpec {
    name
    irreversible: bool
    verify: RecordCheck[]
    connector
  }
  class ToolCall {
    tool_name
    arguments
    request_id
    agent_id
    correlation_id
    rationale_untrusted
    +digest()
  }
  class ToolCallDecision {
    approved: bool
    outcome
    approver
    +parse(reply, pending)
  }
  abstract class BaseToolCallAuditLog {
    +record(event)
    +create_pending(call)
    +transition(from, to)
  }
  class SQLiteToolCallAuditLog
  class ToolCallPendingReview
}

package "Existing in K9-AIF (extended in 1.25.0)" {
  abstract class BaseAgent {
    execute() wrapper:\nopens a gate session,\nre-raises a swallowed review
  }
  abstract class BaseConnector {
    call_tool() wrapper:\nroutes to the dispatcher
  }
  class BaseOrchestrator {
    +handle_requires_hil(exc)
    +resume_tool_call(payload)
  }
  class RequiresHIL
}

package "Existing in K9-AIF (used as they are)" {
  class ShieldGovernance
  abstract class BaseOrigin {
    +get_current(entity, id)
  }
  abstract class BaseRulesAdapter {
    +execute(facts)
  }
}

BaseAgent ..> BaseToolDispatcher : builds from config
BaseConnector --> BaseToolDispatcher : intercepted calls
BaseToolDispatcher --> ToolCall
BaseToolDispatcher --> ShieldGovernance : screens
BaseToolDispatcher --> ToolRegistry
ToolRegistry --> ToolSpec
BaseToolDispatcher --> BaseOrigin : looks up records
BaseToolDispatcher --> BaseRulesAdapter : allow / deny / hil
BaseToolDispatcher --> BaseToolCallAuditLog : records, holds calls
BaseToolCallAuditLog <|-- SQLiteToolCallAuditLog
BaseToolDispatcher --> ToolCallDecision : reads the reply
BaseToolDispatcher ..> ToolCallPendingReview : raises
RequiresHIL <|-- ToolCallPendingReview
BaseOrchestrator ..> ToolCallPendingReview : publishes the review
BaseOrchestrator --> BaseToolDispatcher : resume
@enduml
